{"ref":"BDB, גְּדוּלָּה","hw":"גְּדוּלָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוּלָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. greatness</strong>—<a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.21\">2 S 7:21</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֻלָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.11\">1 Ch 29:11</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֻלַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 10:2\" href=\"/Esther.10.2\">Est 10:2</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוּלָּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:4\" href=\"/Esther.1.4\">Est 1:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֻלָּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:3\" href=\"/Psalms.145.3\">ψ 145:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֻלָּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:21\" href=\"/Psalms.71.21\">ψ 71:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְדֻלָּו֯תְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:6\" href=\"/Psalms.145.6\">ψ 145:6</a>; pl. intens. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֻלּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.19\">1 Ch 17:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.21\">21</a>;—chiefly late Heb.<br><strong>a.</strong>  of Psalmist <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:21\" href=\"/Psalms.71.21\">ψ 71:21</a>, Mordecai <a data-ref=\"Esther 6:3\" href=\"/Esther.6.3\">Est 6:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 10:2\" href=\"/Esther.10.2\">10:2</a>, king <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:4\" href=\"/Esther.1.4\">Est 1:4</a>;<br><strong>b.</strong>  <em>of God’s greatness</em>, as an attribute <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.11\">1 Ch 29:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:3\" href=\"/Psalms.145.3\">ψ 145:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:6\" href=\"/Psalms.145.6\">6</a>, or of his acts <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.21\">2 S 7:21</a> (cf. Dr) v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.23\">23</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.19\">1 Ch 17:19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.21\">21</a>.","next":"BDB, הַגְּדוֹלִים","prev":"BDB, גָּדוֹל"}